# Laragentic - Project Overview

Laragentic is a Laravel package that **extends** the official [Laravel AI SDK](https://laravel.com/docs/12.x/ai-sdk) (`laravel/ai`) by providing agentic loops and other agentic AI capabilities.

## Purpose

The Laravel AI SDK provides agents, tools, streaming, conversations, and structured output — but it does **not** provide autonomous agent loops (e.g. ReAct, Plan-and-Execute). This package fills that gap by adding:

- **Agentic loops** (starting with `ReActLoop`) that let agents autonomously reason, act, and observe in iterative cycles
- **Lifecycle callbacks** so developers can hook into every step of the loop (e.g. streaming progress to users)
- **Configurable iteration limits** to prevent runaway loops
- Future agentic patterns (Plan-and-Execute, reflection, multi-agent orchestration)

## Key Principle

This package **does not replace or duplicate** the Laravel AI SDK. It composes on top of it. Agents still implement `Laravel\Ai\Contracts\Agent`, use `Laravel\Ai\Promptable`, and follow all existing Laravel AI SDK conventions. Laragentic adds traits and classes that enhance those agents with agentic behavior.

## Package Identity

- **Composer package**: `laragentic/agents`
- **Root namespace**: `Laragentic`
- **Minimum PHP**: 8.2
- **Minimum Laravel**: 12.x
- **Required dependency**: `laravel/ai`
